# Environment for `./harness/run perf` (build and every measured run; see docs/testing.md, Performance).
# Time the optimized LLVM-backend build (build.sh, NOTES.md "Build modes"): the default x64 build is ~5-8x slower
# and hides the algorithms behind the backend. The first perf run after a source change builds it (~2 min); check
# switches back to the cached x64 build.
JAI_BUILD=optimized
